lore = "A broad iron crescent for gathering the scattered. Sweep, hook, cast the iron outward, then catch its return and reap."
synergy_name = "Hook and Reap"
synergy_description = "Broad sweep · return hook · throw and catch · finishing reap.\nSecond cut draws Light enemies inward; heavier enemies resist.\nThird cut throws the scythe, pauses while spinning, then recalls it. Each target can take 65% damage outward and 35% on return, once per leg. Terrain shortens the throw. Attack speed quickens the entire sequence.\nFinal cut deals +25% damage below 40% HP, never an automatic execution.\nHold LMB to continue; Space queues dodge."
